{"id":312,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"基礎力と考える力を育む明大明治中","feature_description":"明治大学付属明治中学校は、中学段階で基礎力を養い、知識量だけでなく事象を分析して本質を見抜く洞察力を重視しています。学習活動で「書く」ことを通じ、課題解決に必要な思考力・判断力・表現力を段階的に伸ばします。また、資格取得や班・部活動で仲間と苦労を乗り越える経験も大切にし、将来のキャリアにつながる洞察力・実践力・社会力・精神力の四つの力を育てます。","clubs":[{"id":5502,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meiji.ac.jp/ko_chu/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5504,"name":"中学野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meiji.ac.jp/ko_chu/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5506,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meiji.ac.jp/ko_chu/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5507,"name":"スキー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meiji.ac.jp/ko_chu/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5508,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meiji.ac.jp/ko_chu/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5509,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meiji.ac.jp/ko_chu/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5511,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meiji.ac.jp/ko_chu/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5512,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meiji.ac.jp/ko_chu/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5513,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meiji.ac.jp/ko_chu/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5514,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meiji.ac.jp/ko_chu/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5515,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meiji.ac.jp/ko_chu/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5516,"name":"硬式テニス部（男子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.meiji.ac.jp/ko_chu/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5517,"name":"硬式テニス